#' Moth Bean Nutrient Management Trial (RCBD, Simulated)
#'
#' Simulated randomized complete block experiment on moth bean
#' (\emph{Vigna aconitifolia}) with eight nutrient management treatments in
#' four blocks and eight traits.
#'
#' @format A data frame with 32 rows and 10 variables:
#' \describe{
#'   \item{block}{Factor, block (R1-R4).}
#'   \item{treatment}{Factor, eight treatments (control, recommended dose
#'     of fertilizer (RDF), and RDF with biofertilizers, FYM, sulphur or
#'     zinc).}
#'   \item{seed_yield}{Seed yield (kg/ha).}
#'   \item{plant_height}{Plant height at harvest (cm).}
#'   \item{branches_per_plant}{Branches per plant.}
#'   \item{pods_per_plant}{Pods per plant.}
#'   \item{seeds_per_pod}{Seeds per pod.}
#'   \item{test_weight}{1000-seed weight (g).}
#'   \item{stover_yield}{Stover yield (kg/ha).}
#'   \item{harvest_index}{Harvest index (\%).}
#' }
#' @source Simulated with \code{data-raw/make_datasets.R} (seed 2026).
#'   Not real experimental data.
#' @examples
#' data(mothbean_rbd)
#' anova_rbd(mothbean_rbd, "seed_yield", "treatment", "block")
"mothbean_rbd"

#' Cluster Bean Irrigation x Nitrogen Trial (Split Plot, Simulated)
#'
#' Simulated split-plot experiment on cluster bean (\emph{Cyamopsis
