#' Mung Bean Chlorophyll over Time (Repeated Measures, Simulated)
#'
#' Simulated repeated measurements of leaf chlorophyll (SPAD) on the same
#' plots at 25, 35, 45 and 55 days after sowing, for four foliar spray
#' treatments in four randomized complete blocks. Errors within a plot
#' follow a first-order autoregressive process.
#'
#' @format A data frame with 64 rows and 5 variables:
#' \describe{
#'   \item{block}{Factor, block (R1-R4).}
#'   \item{treatment}{Factor, foliar spray treatment.}
#'   \item{das}{Days after sowing (25, 35, 45, 55).}
#'   \item{plot}{Factor, plot identifier (block-treatment).}
#'   \item{spad}{SPAD chlorophyll meter reading.}
#' }
#' @source Simulated with \code{data-raw/make_datasets.R} (seed 2026).
#'   Not real experimental data.
#' @examples
#' data(mungbean_repeated)
#' anova_repeated(mungbean_repeated, "spad", "treatment", "das",
#'                block = "block")
"mungbean_repeated"
